  "title": "Grandma Amico's Buttermilk Sugar Cookie Cutouts",
  "description": "Grandma Amico's buttermilk sugar cookie cutouts recipe yields soft, fluffy cookies. You can refrigerate the dough for one week or freeze it for longer.",
  "authors": [
    "Lindsey Vedder"
  ],
  "date_published": "2020-06-19T00:42:40-04:00",
